# Simple Skill Manager — optional environment overrides.
# Copy to .env.local to use. Both default sensibly; you usually need neither.

# Root under which agent dirs (.claude, .codex, …) live.
# Default: your real home dir. Set this to a sandbox tree for safe testing.
# SSM_AGENT_ROOT=/absolute/path/to/sandbox/home

# Where the central library + SQLite DB + config live.
# Default: ~/.simple-skill-manager
# SSM_DATA_DIR=/absolute/path/to/data
